    "body": "<a href=\"#\"><img alt=\"P2\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p2.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\"></a> **Unnamed controls pass the lint**\n\nThe naming lint accepts properties that never reach `Accessible.name`. For example, `PanelSlider` and `ToggleSwitch` only use `accessibleName`, but this table also accepts `tooltipText` and `label`. A caller can therefore pass the check while leaving its control unnamed. Match each entry to the component's actual name fallback, and add negative fi",
